Good morning everyone. Today, I am going to present CI/CD, which stands for Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery or Deployment. In modern software engineering, companies cannot afford to release updates only once or twice a year. Customers demand features fast, and they expect them to work perfectly. CI/CD is the automation engine that makes this possible. Over the next few minutes, we will look at how it works, why it matters, and the tools that power it.